Package: @PACKAGE@
Version: @VERSION@
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Description: Nexus-BS TETRA base station runtime
 Nexus-BS packaged from the compiled_distribution binary bundle.
 .
 The package installs runtime binaries and dashboard assets under
 /opt/nexus-bs, systemd service templates under /lib/systemd/system, and
 example configuration under /etc/nexus-bs/examples and seeds
 /etc/nexus-bs/config.toml only when the live file is missing.
 .
 Services are not enabled or started automatically. Review
 /etc/nexus-bs/config.toml, then run: nexus-bs-service start.
